      "lines": [
        "141. 已知平行六面体$ABCDA_1B_1C_1D_1$. 证明：$(A_1DB)$",
        "$\\parallel(D_1CB_1)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "142",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "142. 已知平行平面$\\alpha$和$\\beta$. 通过不属于这两个平面中",
        "任何一个的点$M$作直线$a$和$b$，与平面$\\alpha$分别交于点$A_1$和",
        "$B_1$，与平面$\\beta$交于$A_2$和$B_2$. 已知$|MA_1|=8\\mathrm{cm}$，$|A_1A_2|↵=12\\mathrm{cm}$，$|A_2B_2|=25\\mathrm{cm}$. 求$|A_1B_1|$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "143",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "143. 已知$\\alpha\\parallel\\beta$. $\\gamma\\cap\\delta=m$，$\\gamma\\cap\\alpha=a$，$\\delta\\cap\\beta=b$，$m\\parallel a$.",
        "证明：$m\\parallel b$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "144",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "144. 求过已知点且和已知平面平行的所有直线的并集."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "145",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$145^*$. 作平行六面体$ABCDA_1B_1C_1D_1$的截面，截平面为",
        "$MNP$，如果点$M$、$N$、$P$分别属于：1) 棱$AB$，面$AA_1D_1D$和",
        "$BB_1C_1C$；2) 面$ABCD$、$AA_1B_1B$、$BB_1C_1C$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "146",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "146. 在四面体$ABCD$中，连结顶点$D$同面$ABC$的中线",
        "交点$M$的线段. 求作四面体的截面，截平面通过点$N\\in[DM]$",
        "和平行面$[BCD]$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "147",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$147^*$. 在平行六面体的三条两两异面的棱上取三个点. 通",
        "过这三个点作截面."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "148",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "148. 正方体的截面可能是下列图形吗？1) 正三角形；",
        "2) 正方形；3) 正五边形；4) 正六边形；5) 正八边形."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
